      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُظِلٌّ</span></b>  A thing <i>having shade; by means of which
one shades himself;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُظَلِّلٌ</span></b> . (Msb.)
And [A <i>cloudy</i> day;] a day <i>having clouds:</i> or
<i>having continual shade.</i> (TA.)

